#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/auto_respond.ex:105
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Automatically run a command when someone joins, leaves, or changes their nickname.\nSubcommands: list, add <trigger> [#channel] <command>, remove <position>. No args opens the dialog.\nValid triggers: on_join, on_part, on_nick_change.\nUse $nick in your command to reference the triggering user. The remove subcommand takes a 0-based index number."
msgstr ""
"當有人加入,離開,或更改他們的暱稱時,自動運行一個命令.\n"
"子命令:列表,增加<trigger> [#channel] <command>,刪除<position>. 沒有參數打開對話框 。\n"
"有效觸發器:在 join,在 part,在 nick change上.\n"
"在命令中使用$nick來引用觸發用戶 。 刪除子命令需要基於 0 的索引編號 。"

